---
// Fallback for the notification click target. nginx answers /pn with a 302
// (configs/nginx/1time.conf), which wins as an exact match, so this page only
// serves where that block is absent: a self-hosted deployment behind another
// server, or the window between shipping the bundle and reloading nginx.
//
// No BaseLayout on purpose. The header, nav and CSS would delay a page nobody
// is meant to look at.
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <meta charset="utf-8" />
        <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
        <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0;url=/my-secrets/" />
        <title>Redirecting…</title>
        <script is:inline>
            // replace(), not href: Back would otherwise return here and bounce
            // forward again.
            location.replace('/my-secrets/');
        </script>
    </head>
    <body>
        <a href="/my-secrets/">Continue to My Secrets</a>
    </body>
</html>
